sequenceDiagram
actor A as Participant A
actor B as Participant B
participant G as Node gateway
participant S as Spring signaling and chat service
participant DB as SQL / S3
participant T as TURN relay
A->>G: authenticated chat / ICE config
G->>S: validate session and active membership
G-->>A: temporary ICE servers
A->>S: POST message (TEXT or IMAGE)
S->>DB: DIRECT history / image object
Note over S,DB: GROUP text is live-only; image URL still stored in object storage
S-->>A: message response
S-->>B: STOMP message
A->>S: OFFER / ICE
S-->>B: validated signaling
B->>S: ANSWER / ICE
S-->>A: signaling
alt direct connectivity
A->>B: encrypted WebRTC audio/video/screen
else NAT needs relay
A->>T: encrypted WebRTC transport
T->>B: relay media
end
